  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the fresh produce."
    },
    {
      "text": "Juice lemon into a blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop chives. Add to the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Shave cilantro leaves off the stems; discard stems and add leaves to the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add yogurt, oil, capers, and spices to the blender. Blend on high until smooth, adding water, 1 teaspoon at a time, if needed, to reach a drizzling consistency. Set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel, trim, and quarter carrots lengthwise, then cut crosswise into 3-inch long sticks."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide carrots and dip between plates. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
